WEBVTT

00:06.250 --> 00:09.625
THIS FILM IS A WORK OF FICTION
CREATED FOR ENTERTAINMENT PURPOSES ONLY

00:11.416 --> 00:13.416
[eerie music playing]

00:22.416 --> 00:26.125
DUBAI

00:26.958 --> 00:29.041
[nurse] Get the gauze
and notify the doctor.

00:29.125 --> 00:30.625
[panting]

00:30.708 --> 00:32.083
[tense music playing]

00:32.625 --> 00:34.625
[patient coughing]

00:36.916 --> 00:38.291
[nurse] He needs the blood now.

00:38.375 --> 00:40.208
[spitting]

00:43.875 --> 00:46.000
[monitor beeping]

00:48.791 --> 00:50.791
[monitor 2 beeping faster]

00:52.958 --> 00:55.041
OUT OF 8 BILLION PEOPLE ON EARTH

00:55.125 --> 00:59.375
ONLY 0.00000625%
HAVE THE RAREST BLOOD TYPE

00:59.458 --> 01:01.750
[monitor beeping steadily]

01:01.833 --> 01:03.291
[labored breathing]

01:07.791 --> 01:09.791
[labored breathing continues]

01:16.041 --> 01:19.625
FOR THOSE WHO NEED IT,
THIS BLOOD TYPE CAN MEAN LIFE OR DEATH

01:19.708 --> 01:22.666
THEY CALL THEMSELVES AURUM BLOOD

01:22.750 --> 01:24.750
[labored breathing]

01:27.958 --> 01:29.958
[tense music continues]

01:31.958 --> 01:33.166
[man] You know,

01:33.250 --> 01:35.208
if we take any more blood from him,

01:35.291 --> 01:36.500
he'll die.

01:37.083 --> 01:39.708
[woman] So be it. My boss must live.

01:41.958 --> 01:43.375
But you have to think of what--

01:43.458 --> 01:44.875
I'll find another.

01:45.583 --> 01:48.333
Aurum blood isn't something
you can just find.

01:48.416 --> 01:50.333
Do as I say.

01:51.125 --> 01:54.416
And keep all his organs.
We may need them later.

02:03.541 --> 02:05.541
[cardiac monitor beeping faster]

02:05.625 --> 02:07.041
[gasping]

02:09.041 --> 02:11.041
[cardiac monitor beeping slows down]

02:12.041 --> 02:14.166
[cardiac monitor emits a continuous tone]

02:19.208 --> 02:20.958
[music intensifies]

02:27.375 --> 02:28.416
[woman sighs]

02:28.500 --> 02:30.291
[music fading gradually]

02:30.375 --> 02:32.375
[ringing tone]

02:33.375 --> 02:36.250
Get me the new source. Forget the cost.

02:36.750 --> 02:38.875
[man] Okay, I'm on it.

02:39.750 --> 02:43.125
VIETNAM

02:47.625 --> 02:50.000
[indistinct screaming
and wailing in distance]

02:55.375 --> 02:56.458
[spits]

03:03.083 --> 03:05.083
[all shouting]

03:08.041 --> 03:09.333
[gunshot]

03:10.875 --> 03:12.875
[screaming]

03:18.708 --> 03:20.500
[somber music playing]

03:31.916 --> 03:33.916
[somber music swells]

03:39.791 --> 03:41.791
[girl screaming]

03:47.416 --> 03:48.333
Whoa.

03:49.625 --> 03:51.541
[grunts, screams]

03:52.625 --> 03:54.166
[both grunt]

03:54.958 --> 03:56.958
[man 1 sighs]

03:59.833 --> 04:01.833
[screaming]

04:02.750 --> 04:04.541
[both grunt]

04:05.291 --> 04:07.291
[birds chirping]

04:09.750 --> 04:11.166
[man 2] The choice is yours to make.

04:12.250 --> 04:14.875
Whatever way
you want them to die can be done.

04:14.958 --> 04:19.500
A car accident, poisoning.
We'll make it look like a suicide.

04:20.208 --> 04:23.666
If the target has protection,
we can take them out as well.

04:24.166 --> 04:27.333
I'll send you our package
and price list, okay?

04:27.416 --> 04:30.958
We can talk when I'm back in the office.
I'm busy right now.

04:33.166 --> 04:34.166
All right.

04:37.500 --> 04:41.333
So this kid,
you really think she's gonna be the one?

04:44.666 --> 04:46.666
We're both gonna find out together.

04:48.125 --> 04:50.041
[tense music playing]

04:50.125 --> 04:50.958
Hey.

04:52.500 --> 04:55.041
You've cleared everything
with the parents, right?

04:55.625 --> 04:58.333
No problems.
They'll allow her to come with us.

04:58.416 --> 04:59.916
The payment's been made.

05:00.833 --> 05:02.833
[music turns sinister]

05:14.625 --> 05:17.041
[man 1] Up. Get up.

05:19.416 --> 05:20.666
[grunts]

05:40.333 --> 05:41.625
Who the hell are you?

05:48.583 --> 05:50.583
[music turns tense]

05:54.875 --> 05:56.083
[sniffles]

05:58.000 --> 05:59.291
[tense music builds]

06:00.250 --> 06:01.708
-[man 2 shouts]
-[music fades]

06:11.791 --> 06:12.750
[both grunt]

06:13.541 --> 06:14.833
[shouts in effort]

06:14.916 --> 06:16.333
-[grunts]
-[yelps]

06:17.333 --> 06:19.291
[both grunting]

06:20.000 --> 06:20.958
[gunshot]

06:21.708 --> 06:22.666
[both grunting]

06:24.041 --> 06:25.333
-[grunts]
-[yells]

06:25.416 --> 06:27.083
[tense music playing]

06:27.166 --> 06:28.375
[gun cocks]

06:30.250 --> 06:31.208
[screams]

06:35.791 --> 06:37.791
[music fading]

06:45.833 --> 06:48.541
[man 3] Hey, the girl's in a bad way.

06:54.458 --> 06:55.833
[dramatic music plays]

06:55.916 --> 07:01.750
MY DEAREST ASSASSIN

07:07.625 --> 07:08.458
[man 3] Hm.

07:08.541 --> 07:12.625
I can't think of any assassin houses
using a gun like this.

07:13.125 --> 07:14.791
Who do you think that guy is?

07:15.375 --> 07:16.750
He's got to be a Hunter.

07:17.458 --> 07:18.916
Freelance assassin hire.

07:19.625 --> 07:21.958
Paid to find anything for anyone.

07:22.041 --> 07:24.208
People, animals, objects.

07:24.291 --> 07:26.833
As long as the price is right,
they'll get it.

07:27.333 --> 07:29.416
[woman] Do you know who took the girl?

07:33.250 --> 07:36.041
Since you already took
part of the payment,

07:37.125 --> 07:39.666
that will put you in debt with us.

07:40.291 --> 07:42.625
If you can find an Aurum blood,

07:42.708 --> 07:45.375
whether it be a new one or an old one…

07:48.541 --> 07:49.875
I don't care.

07:50.833 --> 07:52.833
[ominous music plays]

07:56.750 --> 07:59.166
You must find one.

08:11.458 --> 08:13.791
What do you think? He working contract?

08:13.875 --> 08:17.208
Or maybe hunting on the open market.

08:17.708 --> 08:20.666
There's a market out there,
whether it's organs or blood.

08:21.791 --> 08:23.958
This is not going to be easy for us.

08:24.041 --> 08:26.041
[ominous music continues to play]

08:28.583 --> 08:31.083
We're gonna need to keep
a close eye on her.

08:32.208 --> 08:35.291
I get the feeling
everyone's gonna be after this girl.

08:36.000 --> 08:37.541
[music fades]

08:37.625 --> 08:40.541
BANGKOK

08:40.625 --> 08:42.291
[girl screaming]

08:42.375 --> 08:43.625
[woman 2] Hey, wait.

08:43.708 --> 08:45.416
[girl continues to scream]

08:45.500 --> 08:46.541
[woman 2] Hey.

08:46.625 --> 08:48.625
[screaming]

08:48.708 --> 08:50.083
[screaming stops]

08:51.333 --> 08:53.083
No one's gonna hurt you, okay?

08:53.583 --> 08:54.583
Hey.

08:54.666 --> 08:57.083
[in sign language] Come on, hurry!

08:57.166 --> 08:59.750
Hello. Here you are welcome.

09:00.416 --> 09:02.916
[female voice translates in Vietnamese]

09:03.750 --> 09:05.958
Everyone here is friendly.

09:06.458 --> 09:09.625
We will care for you
just like family, okay?

09:10.541 --> 09:12.541
[female voice translates in Vietnamese]

09:13.083 --> 09:16.125
[female voice continues]

09:17.208 --> 09:18.166
-[shouts]
-[all] Hey!

09:19.750 --> 09:21.250
[tense music playing]

09:21.333 --> 09:22.416
[man 3] Hey.

09:22.500 --> 09:23.458
[woman 2] Hey.

09:25.000 --> 09:26.083
Wait up.

09:26.916 --> 09:28.583
[girl screams]

09:28.666 --> 09:30.083
[woman 2] Look.

09:30.583 --> 09:31.583
[grunts]

09:32.458 --> 09:34.333
[girl panting]

09:37.333 --> 09:39.208
Hey, nice one.

09:39.291 --> 09:41.083
-[woman 2] Hey!
-[man 3] Follow her.

09:42.541 --> 09:43.583
[distressed screaming]

09:43.666 --> 09:44.625
[woman 2] Hey.

09:44.708 --> 09:46.333
-Easy, easy, easy.
-[woman 2] Back up.

09:46.416 --> 09:49.625
-Wait, wait, wait. Hey.
-[man 3] Calm down, please.

09:49.708 --> 09:50.791
[music fades]

09:51.916 --> 09:53.458
-[man 3] Hey.
-[woman 2] It's okay.

09:53.541 --> 09:55.583
[girl continues to scream in distress]

09:55.666 --> 09:56.791
[man 3] Be calm.

09:59.875 --> 10:01.541
[panicked screaming]

10:01.625 --> 10:05.125
You're bleeding. You're bleeding.

10:05.791 --> 10:06.875
[panting]

10:08.750 --> 10:10.125
Bleeding.

10:20.000 --> 10:21.458
[woman 2] Oh my.

10:22.291 --> 10:24.958
Okay. This will just sting a little bit,

10:25.041 --> 10:27.541
but that's definitely
gonna leave a scar, dear.

10:27.625 --> 10:29.000
It's nasty.

10:31.041 --> 10:33.750
I need to take a little blood.
Is that okay?

10:39.125 --> 10:40.541
Little sting.

10:42.625 --> 10:44.625
[somber music playing]

11:04.666 --> 11:07.333
She has no one left
who can look after her.

11:14.750 --> 11:16.250
Could you be there for her?

11:17.875 --> 11:20.500
It's why I brought her here,
to our family.

11:22.625 --> 11:23.750
Just like M?

11:27.625 --> 11:29.625
[somber music continues]

11:37.083 --> 11:38.375
[girl] Back then,

11:38.875 --> 11:40.500
when I first arrived here,

11:41.000 --> 11:43.750
I had no idea
why these people had saved me.

11:45.041 --> 11:46.666
Or why I had to stay.

11:47.500 --> 11:50.041
But as soon as I looked into his eyes,

11:50.125 --> 11:51.666
he made me feel calm.

11:51.750 --> 11:54.958
And I knew
that he was someone I could trust.

11:55.541 --> 12:00.041
This young girl's blood is compatible
with any RH null blood type.

12:00.125 --> 12:04.000
You're a very lucky man.
Cases like this are unbelievably rare.

12:04.083 --> 12:08.083
Could her parents have had the same blood?

12:08.750 --> 12:12.000
It may be recessive genes coming together.

12:12.083 --> 12:14.083
[suspenseful, tense music playing]

12:16.958 --> 12:20.125
-[man 2] So when can we start collecting?
-[man 4] Patience.

12:20.208 --> 12:21.791
She's still far too young.

12:21.875 --> 12:25.958
Once the blood is drawn,
it will only last 40 days.

12:26.041 --> 12:30.958
Remember, with blood,
it's best to keep it warm in the host.

12:36.958 --> 12:41.166
[girl] I became a member of House 89
through no choice of my own.

12:45.958 --> 12:48.708
A place that looks like
a typical antique shop,

12:49.291 --> 12:50.958
except it's not.

12:57.458 --> 12:59.458
[suspenseful, tense music continues]

13:18.541 --> 13:22.083
[girl] The only thing
that I am free to do in this house

13:23.833 --> 13:28.666
is remember the one person
who took everything from me.

13:33.875 --> 13:35.041
Hm.

13:38.875 --> 13:40.458
[man 2] Keep a close watch on her.

13:40.541 --> 13:42.916
Under no circumstances
does she leave the house.

14:13.750 --> 14:16.666
[gentle music playing]

14:52.958 --> 14:54.958
[music fades]

14:55.833 --> 14:56.666
[in Vietnamese] Rain.

15:00.833 --> 15:04.000
[in English] Rain. Rain.

15:05.416 --> 15:06.583
Rain.

15:10.750 --> 15:11.791
Pran.

15:14.000 --> 15:15.000
Lhan.

15:18.458 --> 15:22.083
Hey, what's going on?
Come in. You're gonna catch a cold.

15:22.916 --> 15:23.958
No, you come here.

15:24.041 --> 15:25.791
-Huh?
-M, come on.

15:25.875 --> 15:28.041
-Don't be scared.
-[M] What do you mean? No way.

15:28.125 --> 15:29.833
-Come on, M, let's go!
-What are you doing?

15:32.500 --> 15:34.500
[gentle music playing]

15:36.333 --> 15:38.333
-Scared of rain?
-[M laughs]

16:05.666 --> 16:07.666
[inaudible]

16:13.875 --> 16:15.875
[gentle music continues]

16:45.291 --> 16:47.291
[music fades]

17:02.166 --> 17:03.083
[Pran] Hm.

17:03.791 --> 17:04.833
Your turn.

17:10.791 --> 17:11.791
[grunts softly]

17:29.583 --> 17:32.500
INDIA

17:32.583 --> 17:35.166
[tense sitar music playing]

17:35.250 --> 17:38.125
-[man] How long will it take?
-A couple of minutes. We'll see results.

17:48.125 --> 17:49.541
[sighs]

17:57.166 --> 17:59.625
-[man] Has the report been confirmed?
-Get out of here.

18:00.583 --> 18:04.166
-Where do these people come from?
-[man 2] Come over here. Check this.

18:07.416 --> 18:09.750
It's fine, brother. It's negative.

18:14.041 --> 18:15.833
All confirmed Rh type,

18:15.916 --> 18:17.500
but not the blood we want.

18:18.000 --> 18:19.000
[sighs]

18:19.625 --> 18:21.375
[car horn honks]

18:22.583 --> 18:25.666
[tense, eerie music playing]

18:28.500 --> 18:30.041
[sighs]

18:36.958 --> 18:38.958
Keep it cool.
I know you're not, but listen to me.

18:39.041 --> 18:42.166
There's a lot of people in this country.
Some may have fallen off the grid.

18:42.250 --> 18:44.125
[muffled grunting]

18:47.666 --> 18:49.125
[grunts mockingly]

18:49.208 --> 18:50.375
[gunshot]

18:50.458 --> 18:51.541
[thud]

18:52.416 --> 18:53.916
[sighs] Shit.

18:55.000 --> 18:56.000
[sighs heavily]

18:58.375 --> 19:00.250
Ugh, ah.

19:10.291 --> 19:12.291
[cell phone vibrating]

19:15.208 --> 19:16.250
There's none here.

19:17.166 --> 19:21.416
It's been a long time since we last found
anyone with Aurum blood.

19:22.125 --> 19:24.208
You have to go back to Vietnam

19:24.291 --> 19:27.833
and find the one who knows
where they took her.

19:27.916 --> 19:29.375
Vietnam?

19:31.416 --> 19:34.583
I don't think
the ones who took her are Hunters, okay?

19:36.000 --> 19:38.541
I don't even know who they are.
I'm afraid that--

19:38.625 --> 19:40.833
You've already gotten 20 million.

19:41.625 --> 19:43.625
Even if they are God,

19:43.708 --> 19:45.375
you bring her back.

19:45.458 --> 19:47.416
[eerie music intensifies]

19:49.416 --> 19:50.916
[sighs]

19:55.416 --> 19:57.166
[music peaks and fades]

19:57.250 --> 19:58.458
[shouts]

20:04.500 --> 20:06.500
[grunting]

20:08.041 --> 20:10.583
[men grunting]

20:11.166 --> 20:14.916
Why does M have to practice so much?
So full on.

20:15.416 --> 20:16.250
It's a duty.

20:17.208 --> 20:19.041
Everyone in the house has a role.

20:19.125 --> 20:20.500
[men grunting as they spar]

20:20.583 --> 20:22.875
What's mine? What's my role?

20:24.250 --> 20:25.500
Nothing.

20:25.583 --> 20:26.791
I guess.

20:28.541 --> 20:29.791
Why not?

20:29.875 --> 20:31.750
Then what about you?

20:33.625 --> 20:35.000
I don't have one either.

20:35.083 --> 20:36.166
[grunting continues]

20:37.000 --> 20:38.166
Caring for you.

20:39.208 --> 20:41.208
[gentle music playing]

20:43.458 --> 20:45.833
Your job is to keep me at home.

20:49.958 --> 20:52.000
You're safe more than anywhere.

20:52.708 --> 20:54.708
I'm safe locked inside.

20:55.291 --> 20:56.583
That's called fear.

20:57.125 --> 20:59.250
[both grunt and shout]

21:05.291 --> 21:06.375
[grunts]

21:08.041 --> 21:12.708
[in sign language] Not strong enough.
Haven't trained enough. Not fast enough.

21:18.083 --> 21:19.041
[yelps]

21:21.541 --> 21:22.875
[Lhan] Come on, kiddo.

21:22.958 --> 21:24.208
Do your job.

21:24.291 --> 21:25.625
-Hm.
-Hm, hm, hm.

21:26.500 --> 21:27.458
Mm.

21:28.000 --> 21:29.791
You're too predictable for him.

21:30.291 --> 21:32.958
He knows
when you're gonna move left or right.

21:35.541 --> 21:36.541
Come on.

21:37.541 --> 21:38.708
Try it with me.

21:40.916 --> 21:41.916
Uh-huh.

21:43.916 --> 21:44.916
Okay.

21:49.000 --> 21:50.041
[Pran] You ready?

21:51.166 --> 21:53.041
[M] Yeah. Okay.

21:53.541 --> 21:55.541
[Pran exhaling]

21:58.416 --> 21:59.291
[grunts]

22:03.125 --> 22:03.958
[Lhan] Hey!

22:04.041 --> 22:05.250
When did you learn?

22:07.375 --> 22:08.291
Uh…

22:09.291 --> 22:12.250
This guy, he's been making me
teach him for years.

22:13.250 --> 22:14.625
He never lets me sleep.

22:14.708 --> 22:15.541
[Pran] Hey.

22:15.625 --> 22:17.208
It's our secret.

22:23.000 --> 22:24.208
Go again.

22:24.791 --> 22:25.916
Yeah, okay.

22:26.791 --> 22:27.791
Come on.

22:28.666 --> 22:30.083
[tense music playing]

22:33.083 --> 22:34.083
[grunts]

22:36.583 --> 22:37.666
[M] Yeah.

22:39.416 --> 22:40.500
[groans]

22:41.833 --> 22:43.083
[grunts]

22:46.250 --> 22:48.375
-Ah!
-[Pran] You see?

22:50.083 --> 22:51.625
You need to flip your moves.

22:51.708 --> 22:54.916
Switch it front to back.
Go right, not left.

22:56.416 --> 22:58.291
Shit. You're right, man.

22:58.375 --> 23:00.083
[music turns energetic]

23:00.166 --> 23:01.458
[both grunting]

23:08.166 --> 23:10.750
[Pran] You'll catch him off guard,
and then you can get in close.

23:13.583 --> 23:15.583
[energetic music continues]

23:30.208 --> 23:32.166
[Pran] Once you're in control
of the distance,

23:32.250 --> 23:33.875
then you can choose your attack.

23:34.375 --> 23:37.916
And it's about finding
and exploiting his weaknesses.

23:43.041 --> 23:44.916
[Lhan] What if we don't know
who we're fighting?

23:45.000 --> 23:47.166
How do you know their weakness?

23:47.916 --> 23:50.000
Then you have to take a hit first

23:50.500 --> 23:51.750
to find out.

24:04.583 --> 24:06.166
[grunting]

24:10.583 --> 24:12.291
[both grunting with effort]

24:20.125 --> 24:21.750
[music fades]

24:32.791 --> 24:35.750
[Pran] Too much to drink,
and the birthday boy's out cold.

24:39.625 --> 24:41.541
Why don't you tell your dad?

24:41.625 --> 24:42.708
You can fight.

24:42.791 --> 24:44.250
And you're good at it.

24:44.333 --> 24:46.750
[Pran] I'm sure he doesn't want me
doing the work he does.

24:47.416 --> 24:49.250
And having to go outside.

24:49.875 --> 24:52.000
Do you really just wanna sell antiques?

24:52.500 --> 24:55.458
Honestly. Or do you want to go outside?

24:56.000 --> 24:57.125
I guess it's just

24:57.750 --> 24:59.125
how I was raised.

24:59.958 --> 25:01.166
I don't really know

25:01.833 --> 25:03.541
what I actually want.

25:07.875 --> 25:09.333
I like taking care of you.

25:10.000 --> 25:11.083
That's something…

25:12.458 --> 25:13.291
good.

25:19.541 --> 25:20.583
Now,

25:22.333 --> 25:24.541
is there anything you really want to do?

25:30.041 --> 25:31.083
Hm?

25:34.083 --> 25:35.041
Mm…

25:35.541 --> 25:36.750
There is,

25:36.833 --> 25:41.083
but I wouldn't know where I'd even begin.

25:42.750 --> 25:44.750
[gentle music playing]

25:47.875 --> 25:49.166
[blows] We're done.

25:49.250 --> 25:50.458
Here.

25:50.541 --> 25:52.541
Hm? Mm.

25:53.166 --> 25:54.083
In here.

25:55.250 --> 25:57.250
-Hey. No.
-Ah.

25:57.333 --> 25:59.708
-Come on, leave me alone. [grunts softly]
-Stay.

26:13.708 --> 26:17.416
This next job, the target always has
four guards with him.

26:18.958 --> 26:22.833
Entry and exit points
are listed on the map that I gave you.

26:22.916 --> 26:26.791
I also have word that other houses
might also make a move on our job.

26:27.291 --> 26:31.375
[sighs] Damn, not sounding easy. [sighs]

26:35.541 --> 26:36.791
Should M be involved?

26:39.208 --> 26:40.750
What's the thinking?

26:41.833 --> 26:44.291
[man] Yeah. Why not.

26:44.375 --> 26:46.250
I think he's ready.

26:53.458 --> 26:54.666
Then finish eating.

26:54.750 --> 26:56.875
-We'll continue this in the office.
-Mhm.

27:00.333 --> 27:01.958
[door opens]

27:05.708 --> 27:06.583
Go.

27:09.208 --> 27:10.166
Hm.

27:15.041 --> 27:16.791
[door closes]

27:27.666 --> 27:28.500
Hey.

27:30.708 --> 27:32.166
Want to go out and have fun?

27:34.125 --> 27:36.125
[gentle music playing]

27:58.083 --> 27:59.708
[sighing]

28:02.833 --> 28:03.875
Look okay?

28:08.958 --> 28:09.958
What about the hair?

28:10.041 --> 28:10.916
Up.

28:11.416 --> 28:12.500
Down.

28:12.583 --> 28:14.583
Uh… [sighs]

28:16.083 --> 28:17.291
Very pretty.

28:19.000 --> 28:19.916
[sighs]

28:20.416 --> 28:21.541
What's the occasion?

28:21.625 --> 28:22.500
I'm going out.

28:22.583 --> 28:24.083
Pran's taking me out.

28:24.666 --> 28:26.625
Don't tell him this is what I'm wearing.

28:28.208 --> 28:29.708
What did the uncles say?

28:29.791 --> 28:33.000
We're just gonna sneak out.
No one'll be home to know.

28:33.958 --> 28:35.166
Not a word, okay?

28:40.291 --> 28:41.791
You think he'll like it?

28:44.250 --> 28:45.333
He will.

28:47.541 --> 28:48.916
He'd be crazy not to.

28:52.416 --> 28:54.416
[somber music playing]

29:13.833 --> 29:15.458
When do I get my turn, Dad?

29:26.875 --> 29:28.791
Go. Everyone get ready.

29:32.041 --> 29:33.166
[door opens]

29:45.083 --> 29:46.416
[door shuts]

29:48.083 --> 29:50.083
[tense music playing]

29:53.083 --> 29:55.083
[music turns menacing]

29:59.583 --> 30:01.083
Ma'am, this way.

30:07.541 --> 30:09.000
What is this?

30:09.625 --> 30:11.291
And it's worth what?

30:12.208 --> 30:15.000
Crap, so crap, it's bad.

30:15.083 --> 30:17.208
I look better. Huh.

30:21.791 --> 30:22.916
House 89.

30:27.458 --> 30:28.833
Then hurry up.

30:37.416 --> 30:38.583
Mala.

30:42.375 --> 30:43.208
[man] Shit.

30:44.791 --> 30:45.833
What now?

30:49.833 --> 30:52.000
[Dad] The target is in Zone One.

30:52.083 --> 30:53.708
Four bodyguards with him.

30:55.458 --> 30:59.500
Take out the Mala gang first,
then take out the target.

31:04.791 --> 31:06.666
[menacing music continues to play]

31:08.125 --> 31:09.416
[man gasps]

31:10.833 --> 31:11.708
[man grunts]

31:55.500 --> 31:57.625
Did you wear your non-slip shoes, darling?

31:57.708 --> 32:00.083
You don't want to slip
in filthy blood, hm?

32:00.166 --> 32:02.166
[music subsides]

32:03.166 --> 32:04.375
They'll be okay.

32:04.875 --> 32:07.458
Dealing with how you describe your blood.

32:07.541 --> 32:09.166
[tense, menacing music resumes]

32:17.708 --> 32:19.708
[ringing tone]

32:20.541 --> 32:23.833
[Dad] Plan B.
M's the only one they won't recognize.

32:24.333 --> 32:26.375
Time to show them what you've got, kid.

32:27.875 --> 32:29.958
-This way, sir.
-This way.

32:50.041 --> 32:51.125
[watch beeps]

32:58.625 --> 32:59.750
[metallic click]

33:07.708 --> 33:09.000
[music intensifies]

33:14.541 --> 33:15.666
[faint blip]

33:19.833 --> 33:20.875
-[explosion]
-[shouting]

33:20.958 --> 33:24.125
[man] Hey, get down, sir, get down.
We move, come on.

33:24.208 --> 33:27.333
-[people shouting]
-[man groans]

33:27.416 --> 33:31.000
-Out of the way now. Don't stop.
-Hey!

33:31.083 --> 33:32.875
[Dad] The target has entered
the kill zone.

33:32.958 --> 33:33.791
[man] Come on!

33:33.875 --> 33:35.125
[Dad] Take him out.

33:35.208 --> 33:36.875
[man] Come on. Move!

33:36.958 --> 33:38.833
-Move.
-[man 2] You against the wall.

33:38.916 --> 33:40.958
Come on. Move, sir, come on.

33:41.041 --> 33:42.250
[man grunts]

33:42.333 --> 33:44.541
-[blade swishes]
-[man gasps]

33:44.625 --> 33:48.541
[man] Move, move, move. Come on. Move!

33:48.625 --> 33:52.500
[man 2] Hey, hey. Hey, boss, boss.
Hey, sir, sir. Boss, boss!

33:52.583 --> 33:54.708
[music intensifies]

33:57.125 --> 33:59.166
[man grunts] Boss!

34:00.708 --> 34:04.083
[M] Kill confirmed.
The target's been eliminated.

34:10.000 --> 34:12.375
[Dad] Not bad for your first job, kid.

34:16.916 --> 34:20.208
House 89, mission accomplished.

34:25.500 --> 34:28.166
[music peaks then fades]

34:31.791 --> 34:33.791
[exhales]

34:33.875 --> 34:35.416
[gentle music plays]

34:35.500 --> 34:37.500
[inhales]

34:41.875 --> 34:44.208
Here's Amber Hymns by Enoch Rayburne.

34:44.291 --> 34:47.125
The rare hand-pressed final edition.

34:48.208 --> 34:51.291
You are one of 14 people
in the world with a copy.

34:53.333 --> 34:56.833
I like how it sounds. One of 14.

34:57.333 --> 34:59.083
I do as well.

35:00.583 --> 35:03.750
Owning something
with such limited quantity,

35:05.208 --> 35:06.708
it makes you feel…

35:08.208 --> 35:09.458
magnifique.

35:09.541 --> 35:11.041
Yeah.

35:13.416 --> 35:16.666
I hear that you're back
in Thailand for a while.

35:17.666 --> 35:21.041
Are you here to relax,
or you're hunting something for a client?

35:21.125 --> 35:25.333
Hm. Honestly,
I'm looking for something very important

35:25.916 --> 35:28.041
and feel like I'm close to finding it.

35:28.125 --> 35:29.625
[music turns eerie]

35:29.708 --> 35:31.250
How can you be so sure?

35:36.875 --> 35:38.666
'Cause I'm a Hunter.

35:40.166 --> 35:42.000
And I can almost smell it.

35:42.083 --> 35:43.083
[music fades]

36:04.958 --> 36:06.458
Where did you get that?

36:08.708 --> 36:09.833
Do you like it?

36:14.208 --> 36:15.125
Very much.

36:16.083 --> 36:18.083
[gentle music playing]

36:20.125 --> 36:22.541
Hair up or down?

36:49.291 --> 36:51.291
[crowd chatter]

36:59.958 --> 37:05.708
Can I get three of these
and three sausage ones?

37:07.333 --> 37:08.166
Hm?

37:09.500 --> 37:10.916
[Lhan gasps, chuckles]

37:11.625 --> 37:12.458
[woman] Here you go.

37:12.541 --> 37:13.750
-How much?
-[woman] Sixty baht.

37:16.916 --> 37:19.166
[sighs with pleasure]

37:20.041 --> 37:21.666
-You like?
-[sighs softly]

37:23.083 --> 37:24.375
[laughing]

38:25.500 --> 38:27.375
[both laughing]

38:42.916 --> 38:44.500
[eerie music playing]

38:44.583 --> 38:45.875
[screams]

39:13.875 --> 39:15.083
[music fades]

39:25.375 --> 39:27.375
[menacing music playing]

39:33.791 --> 39:35.125
[gate opens with a beep]

39:47.625 --> 39:49.625
[menacing music intensifies]

40:16.708 --> 40:18.166
[chews and grunts]

40:21.708 --> 40:22.625
[grunts]

40:24.208 --> 40:25.208
Mm.

40:25.291 --> 40:26.875
Wo, wo, wo, wow!

40:26.958 --> 40:28.500
Hello, handsome.

40:29.416 --> 40:30.375
[chuckles]

40:30.458 --> 40:32.500
Good evening, Miss Chaba,
and to you, Blue.

40:38.250 --> 40:39.666
[clicks tongue repeatedly]

40:51.375 --> 40:53.125
[Chaba] Wow.

40:57.041 --> 40:58.041
[chuckles]

40:58.625 --> 41:01.958
If you're ready to accept the job,
I have the first payment.

41:03.000 --> 41:04.208
If you accept.

41:09.291 --> 41:10.625
Fucking hell!

41:13.458 --> 41:16.166
What problem do you have with this house?

41:16.666 --> 41:18.666
They took something of mine

41:19.166 --> 41:21.166
and wasted my time tracking it down.

41:21.250 --> 41:23.250
Everyone in this house is a killer.

41:23.333 --> 41:24.166
Mm.

41:24.791 --> 41:29.000
That's exactly why I'm here.
Hit men to kill other hit men.

41:29.083 --> 41:30.875
It's maintaining a balance.

41:42.791 --> 41:43.708
[grunts]

41:45.333 --> 41:48.666
I heard a few days ago
House 89 lost you a lot of money.

41:52.125 --> 41:53.125
[sighs]

41:54.000 --> 41:56.166
Now here's something
for you to think about.

41:56.916 --> 41:59.208
If House 89 was out of the picture,

41:59.291 --> 42:01.541
imagine how much money you could make.

42:04.375 --> 42:05.625
[music fades]

42:18.708 --> 42:21.041
I hear you went out
of the house last night.

42:25.875 --> 42:27.708
We're out there working our asses off.

42:27.791 --> 42:30.125
Somehow, you think rules don't apply.

42:33.875 --> 42:35.708
Let me go out with you sometime.

42:36.875 --> 42:38.166
I need something to do.

42:38.250 --> 42:40.583
What you've been asked to do
is care for Lhan.

42:40.666 --> 42:41.833
And I'm doing that.

42:41.916 --> 42:44.416
Isn't taking her out looking after her?

42:45.125 --> 42:47.208
Her whole time she doesn't go outside.

42:47.291 --> 42:49.250
What sort of life's that?

42:49.333 --> 42:51.958
Everyone here has their own life,
you realize?

42:52.041 --> 42:53.958
But you're not thinking
of anyone else's life,

42:54.041 --> 42:56.250
only your own selfish wants and needs.

42:57.041 --> 42:58.250
Selfish how?

42:58.333 --> 43:00.500
What do I want that's so different?

43:01.000 --> 43:03.458
Wanting Lhan to see life
outside the house.

43:03.541 --> 43:05.458
What's so wrong about that?

43:06.125 --> 43:09.458
You told me to look after her.
I'm doing it.

43:09.541 --> 43:11.583
Why won't you let me do it my own way?

43:12.083 --> 43:14.000
If something does actually go down,

43:14.083 --> 43:16.291
all of that practice
you think you're doing in secret

43:16.375 --> 43:18.083
won't be enough to protect you.

43:18.166 --> 43:19.250
My turn now.

43:19.333 --> 43:22.375
The reason M can beat everyone,
including yourself,

43:23.416 --> 43:24.708
is because of me.

43:25.750 --> 43:27.166
I taught him what to do.

43:30.458 --> 43:31.666
You didn't know.

43:31.750 --> 43:32.791
Never trained your son.

43:32.875 --> 43:35.541
There are people hunting her
outside of this house.

43:35.625 --> 43:38.416
There's a price on her head.
Do you not get that?

43:38.500 --> 43:40.083
What do you mean a price on her head?

43:41.041 --> 43:42.666
How come they want her, Dad?

43:45.000 --> 43:46.750
Why would there be a price?

43:48.583 --> 43:49.500
Why?

43:51.916 --> 43:54.625
-Why won't you tell me?
-People are willing to pay for her blood!

43:55.333 --> 43:56.375
[sighs]

44:00.583 --> 44:01.833
Dad.

44:03.625 --> 44:05.458
You don't understand what it means.

44:05.541 --> 44:08.500
Why she's here,
and why I worked so hard to find her.

44:09.083 --> 44:11.250
There's a bigger picture
that you just don't get,

44:11.333 --> 44:13.416
and yet you run around
doing your own thing.

44:13.500 --> 44:15.916
You know,
maybe I need to separate both of you.

44:16.833 --> 44:17.916
Stop!

44:21.083 --> 44:22.458
[inhales]

44:22.541 --> 44:24.541
[panting]

44:34.500 --> 44:36.166
[gasps, coughs softly]

44:48.208 --> 44:49.333
I know that you love her.

44:50.916 --> 44:52.041
I can see it.

44:52.541 --> 44:55.333
If Lhan stays here in the house,
she will be safe.

44:56.625 --> 44:58.750
But she doesn't go outside.

44:58.833 --> 45:00.708
Not everyone
gets to live the life they want.

45:00.791 --> 45:02.250
They live the life they have to.

45:04.416 --> 45:05.416
Accept this!

45:05.916 --> 45:07.458
It will get easier.

45:07.541 --> 45:09.250
[melancholic music playing]

45:28.125 --> 45:30.125
[melancholic music intensifies]

45:44.166 --> 45:45.625
[music fades]

45:45.708 --> 45:46.666
Go home?

45:46.750 --> 45:47.708
[Pran] Mm-hmm.

45:48.208 --> 45:49.541
Or pick somewhere.

45:49.625 --> 45:52.000
As long as you and I are together.

45:52.083 --> 45:53.666
I will take care of you.

45:53.750 --> 45:55.666
What about the others? And M?

45:56.458 --> 45:57.541
He can't know yet.

45:57.625 --> 45:59.750
We'll figure it out
once we get out of here.

46:01.166 --> 46:03.791
Hurry up and pack. We'll leave tonight.

46:08.916 --> 46:10.916
[tense music playing]

46:26.583 --> 46:27.833
[gate opens with a beep]

46:30.625 --> 46:32.625
[tense music continues]

47:03.916 --> 47:05.166
[music peaks and fades]

47:13.291 --> 47:16.208
PRAN
JUST LEFT MY ROOM

47:21.250 --> 47:23.250
[suspenseful music playing]

47:26.583 --> 47:28.500
[loud bang]

47:38.333 --> 47:39.541
[objects crashing]

47:45.291 --> 47:46.416
[man] Wait.

47:50.625 --> 47:51.916
Leave the woman.

48:01.458 --> 48:02.958
Let's go. Stay close.

48:03.041 --> 48:04.750
[pulsing, tense music playing]

48:08.458 --> 48:10.416
[panting]

48:29.458 --> 48:30.583
[Pran] Hey, get down.

48:32.041 --> 48:33.208
[grunting]

48:36.583 --> 48:38.375
[both grunting]

48:42.291 --> 48:44.250
[yelps, grunts]

48:44.333 --> 48:45.416
[Pran grunts]

48:58.625 --> 49:00.625
[Lhan screams, whimpers]

49:02.791 --> 49:04.791
[Lhan moans in fear]

49:07.500 --> 49:09.041
[men shouting]

49:09.791 --> 49:11.125
[Lhan screams]

49:11.208 --> 49:12.541
[gunshots]

49:14.250 --> 49:16.125
[gunshots continue]

49:18.083 --> 49:19.666
[gunfire continues]

49:28.833 --> 49:30.833
[both grunting]

49:33.833 --> 49:36.500
[grunts, screams]

49:36.583 --> 49:38.583
[grunting]

49:38.666 --> 49:40.708
-[grunts in effort]
-[objects crash]

49:40.791 --> 49:43.041
[grunts, coughs]

49:48.625 --> 49:49.500
[gunshots]

50:00.125 --> 50:01.541
[M] You guys okay?

50:01.625 --> 50:03.125
Go!

50:09.958 --> 50:11.958
[tense music builds]

50:18.791 --> 50:23.333
[heartbeat]

50:24.458 --> 50:26.791
[music peaks, then fades]

50:26.875 --> 50:27.791
[Lhan grunts]

50:29.708 --> 50:31.333
[screaming]

50:33.375 --> 50:35.583
Lhan. Lhan!

50:38.041 --> 50:38.875
Stop.

50:40.625 --> 50:41.916
[grunting]

50:42.833 --> 50:44.125
[blade strikes]

50:44.208 --> 50:45.333
[somber music playing]

50:45.416 --> 50:46.833
[exhales]

50:51.916 --> 50:53.750
[Chaba shouts]

50:54.458 --> 50:55.708
[grunts]

50:57.750 --> 50:58.875
[screams]

50:58.958 --> 51:00.541
-[yelps]
-[Dad shouts]

51:03.083 --> 51:04.333
Pran! [grunts]

51:04.416 --> 51:06.416
[somber music continues]

51:07.541 --> 51:08.541
Hey!

51:22.375 --> 51:23.208
Clear!

51:33.708 --> 51:35.166
[grunts]

51:38.083 --> 51:39.791
[gunshots continue]

51:49.708 --> 51:51.125
[music fades]

51:51.208 --> 51:52.416
[grunting]

51:53.458 --> 51:54.500
[man] Sit him down here.

51:56.916 --> 51:58.916
[guns cock]

52:00.208 --> 52:01.791
-[man] Come here, Lhan.
-[Dad] Take her!

52:01.875 --> 52:03.500
-[grunts]
-[man] Come on.

52:03.583 --> 52:06.166
-Down, down.
-[Lhan grunts]

52:06.250 --> 52:08.708
-Uncle! What are you doing?
-Come down, Lhan. Back off. Go!

52:08.791 --> 52:11.291
-[man] Hold her down.
-Uncle! Uncle!

52:11.375 --> 52:12.708
[Dad] Hurry up, Doc!

52:13.958 --> 52:15.666
[Doc] Hold him still.

52:15.750 --> 52:16.791
Just a second.

52:17.500 --> 52:18.791
Stay still.

52:18.875 --> 52:20.208
Calm down.

52:21.375 --> 52:23.875
-[Doc] Are you okay?
-Hurry up. Get on with it!

52:26.208 --> 52:28.208
[Lhan grunting]

52:30.250 --> 52:32.500
[Doc] Lhek, set up the other bed.

52:38.291 --> 52:39.500
[Pram exclaims]

52:39.583 --> 52:41.416
[Lhek] M, come here. Hurry.

52:41.500 --> 52:42.833
-[M] Okay.
-[Lhek] Come on.

52:51.333 --> 52:54.666
[M] Pran, Pran, I'm here.
Hey, the bleeding won't stop.

52:55.541 --> 52:57.750
[Dad] Keep pressure on it, nice and firm.

52:57.833 --> 52:58.875
Keep pressing.

53:02.583 --> 53:04.250
-[Doc] Stay still.
-[Pran] Shit.

53:07.291 --> 53:08.500
[gunshot]

53:22.166 --> 53:23.416
[in sign language] Let's go!

53:23.916 --> 53:24.875
Come on!

53:32.500 --> 53:34.000
[grunting]

53:42.500 --> 53:44.500
[panting]

53:51.041 --> 53:53.041
[shouts]

53:55.000 --> 53:57.000
[grunting]

54:00.458 --> 54:01.708
[grunts in effort]

54:01.791 --> 54:03.791
-[screams]
-[woman grunts]

54:07.000 --> 54:09.000
[grunting]

54:20.125 --> 54:21.125
[M] Pran, Pran.

54:21.916 --> 54:23.041
Pran.

54:29.916 --> 54:30.791
It's coming.

54:31.375 --> 54:32.750
[M] Doc!

54:34.083 --> 54:34.916
Don't.

54:35.625 --> 54:36.750
Dad.

54:39.000 --> 54:40.041
Please don't.

54:40.125 --> 54:42.375
-Understand.
-[Pran] Dad.

54:46.625 --> 54:47.958
[screams]

54:50.000 --> 54:52.166
[gunshots]

54:52.250 --> 54:54.750
-[man shouts]
-[woman grunts]

55:00.208 --> 55:01.708
-[Pran] Let go of me.
-[Dad] Come here.

55:01.791 --> 55:03.375
[Pran] Leave me alone.

55:03.458 --> 55:05.041
-[Dad] On the table.
-[Lhek] On the table.

55:05.750 --> 55:07.583
-Lay down. Lay down.
-[Dad] Pran…

55:07.666 --> 55:10.083
[Lhek] Stay down. Just hold still, okay?

55:10.916 --> 55:15.041
[Doc] And up.
Hold his legs down, quick, hurry.

55:15.125 --> 55:17.416
-[Lhan cries]
-Fuck you.

55:17.500 --> 55:18.583
-It's okay.
-I don't want it.

55:18.666 --> 55:19.708
[Doc] Hold him down.

55:19.791 --> 55:21.166
-[Lhan] Let me go.
-[Doc] Hold him!

55:22.041 --> 55:24.125
-I don't fucking want this.
-[Lhek] Stay still.

55:24.208 --> 55:25.833
-Stay.
-[Lhan cries]

55:26.458 --> 55:28.000
[Doc] Just keep holding him down.

55:28.083 --> 55:29.291
[somber music playing]

55:29.375 --> 55:30.291
[Lhek] Stay still.

55:30.375 --> 55:31.833
-[Doc] The needle.
-[Lhek] Come on.

55:31.916 --> 55:33.041
[Pran] Let her go.

55:33.541 --> 55:34.750
[Lhan panting]

55:34.833 --> 55:35.666
[Pran] M.

55:36.291 --> 55:38.916
Get her out of here. M.

55:39.000 --> 55:41.000
[somber music continues]

55:43.750 --> 55:44.708
[Lhek] It's okay.

55:57.666 --> 55:59.375
[somber music subsides]

56:20.083 --> 56:22.458
[crying faintly]

56:22.541 --> 56:24.000
[somber music resumes]

56:29.916 --> 56:31.916
[crying]

56:45.500 --> 56:48.041
[Lhan] Pran needs Aurum blood.

56:49.208 --> 56:50.916
He's also a hemophiliac.

56:51.958 --> 56:53.625
It was then that I realized

56:54.125 --> 56:55.875
that I was brought to the house

56:56.791 --> 56:58.666
to be his blood bank.

57:09.375 --> 57:10.416
[woman] Deaw!

57:10.500 --> 57:11.916
[gasps]

57:16.708 --> 57:18.708
[dramatic music playing]

57:26.250 --> 57:27.500
[music peaks, then fades]

57:32.166 --> 57:34.166
[tense music pulsing]

57:38.666 --> 57:41.000
Hey! Open the door!

57:41.083 --> 57:43.125
Are you gonna open or not?

57:43.208 --> 57:44.708
Open the door!

57:44.791 --> 57:46.791
Or your friends are dead.

57:47.750 --> 57:50.375
[tense music intensifies]

57:51.458 --> 57:53.583
[Chaba] I'm beginning the count.

57:54.625 --> 57:55.875
One…

57:58.500 --> 58:00.166
Two…

58:00.250 --> 58:02.250
-[thud]
-[wet squelch]

58:09.458 --> 58:11.458
[eerie, somber music playing]

58:13.416 --> 58:15.416
[laughs darkly]

58:16.041 --> 58:18.500
-You're crazy.
-Oh, yeah.

58:19.833 --> 58:22.500
They're not gonna open it.
[laughing maniacally]

58:23.458 --> 58:25.000
Will he make it out of here?

58:26.500 --> 58:30.541
He needs to have
more clotting factor to help.

58:31.208 --> 58:32.833
You've already given him one.

58:34.708 --> 58:39.208
You said we have to fight our way out.
Then he needs another shot.

58:40.083 --> 58:42.375
He needs it now.

58:47.583 --> 58:48.916
[gun cocks]

59:11.958 --> 59:14.458
[somber music playing]

59:24.250 --> 59:25.416
[Pran sniffles]

59:27.875 --> 59:28.875
You okay?

59:30.875 --> 59:31.708
Yep.

59:32.666 --> 59:34.416
Ready to fight with your dad?

59:45.000 --> 59:46.083
[gun cocks]

01:00:19.625 --> 01:00:20.458
All right.

01:00:23.333 --> 01:00:25.333
[breathes deeply]

01:00:44.916 --> 01:00:46.000
[man] Hey, hey.

01:00:47.333 --> 01:00:48.458
[panicked shouting]

01:00:49.083 --> 01:00:52.208
-[man] Hey, shit.
-[man 2] Go! Go! Get out of here. Quick!

01:00:52.291 --> 01:00:54.291
[music turns dramatic]

01:00:56.375 --> 01:00:57.458
[grunts]

01:01:01.291 --> 01:01:03.291
[screaming]

01:01:07.083 --> 01:01:09.083
[dramatic music continues]

01:01:52.250 --> 01:01:53.291
[grunts]

01:02:00.625 --> 01:02:01.458
[Pran] Dad.

01:02:04.041 --> 01:02:05.541
[music fades]

01:02:08.125 --> 01:02:10.375
Shit. Hey, hey.

01:02:11.458 --> 01:02:12.583
Shit.

01:02:12.666 --> 01:02:13.958
The system's been hacked.

01:02:14.041 --> 01:02:15.375
We're locked in.

01:02:21.041 --> 01:02:23.208
Get everyone out! I'll handle this.

01:02:23.291 --> 01:02:24.958
-[Lhek] Hey, Doc. Quick!
-[M] Uncle!

01:02:25.041 --> 01:02:26.958
-[Pran] Dad. Dad!
-[M] Pran!

01:02:32.625 --> 01:02:34.625
[tense music playing]

01:02:47.708 --> 01:02:48.541
No.

01:02:54.583 --> 01:02:55.416
No.

01:02:55.500 --> 01:02:56.833
-Dad.
-No!

01:02:58.333 --> 01:02:59.583
[gunshot]

01:03:01.250 --> 01:03:03.291
Dad!

01:03:07.291 --> 01:03:08.666
[gunshots]

01:03:08.750 --> 01:03:09.625
-Don't.
-Dad.

01:03:09.708 --> 01:03:10.958
-[Lhek] We gotta go.
-Dad!

01:03:11.041 --> 01:03:12.208
[gunshot]

01:03:15.041 --> 01:03:17.041
[music turns dramatic]

01:03:19.041 --> 01:03:21.041
[inaudible]

01:03:25.916 --> 01:03:28.083
[gunshots continue]

01:03:35.500 --> 01:03:36.666
[pants, grunts]

01:03:36.750 --> 01:03:38.125
[gate opens with a beep]

01:03:40.458 --> 01:03:42.041
[Doc] Let's go. Hurry!

01:03:42.125 --> 01:03:42.958
Okay.

01:04:15.416 --> 01:04:17.375
[faint beeping]

01:04:17.458 --> 01:04:18.416
[continuous beep]

01:04:18.500 --> 01:04:19.583
[man] Bomb!

01:04:20.250 --> 01:04:21.208
[grunts]

01:04:21.791 --> 01:04:23.791
[coughing]

01:04:24.791 --> 01:04:26.833
[objects crash]

01:04:30.041 --> 01:04:31.125
[Pran] Dad!

01:04:33.125 --> 01:04:34.958
[screams]

01:04:36.291 --> 01:04:37.125
[panting]

01:04:37.208 --> 01:04:38.291
Pran.

01:04:39.083 --> 01:04:40.000
Pran.

01:04:41.000 --> 01:04:42.458
We have to go now.

01:04:42.541 --> 01:04:44.791
-Let's go. Let's go.
-Get off me, Uncle.

01:04:46.041 --> 01:04:48.208
We gotta go. We gotta go now.

01:04:48.291 --> 01:04:49.416
[screams]

01:04:49.500 --> 01:04:52.125
Pran, hurry, son. We gotta go.

01:04:52.208 --> 01:04:54.291
-Uncle.
-You have to leave.

01:04:54.375 --> 01:04:55.833
You have to leave him.

01:04:57.916 --> 01:04:59.291
Calm down.

01:04:59.375 --> 01:05:03.333
Enough, kid. Pull yourself together.
Pull yourself together!

01:05:04.125 --> 01:05:04.958
Go.

01:05:05.833 --> 01:05:08.166
They all died, so that we can live.

01:05:08.250 --> 01:05:10.500
Do you understand? Let's go. Hurry.

01:05:11.375 --> 01:05:12.750
Uncle.

01:05:14.375 --> 01:05:15.500
[grunts]

01:05:18.666 --> 01:05:19.750
Let's go.

01:05:19.833 --> 01:05:21.833
[somber music playing]

01:05:25.708 --> 01:05:28.166
[Pran] Dad. Dad!

01:06:02.333 --> 01:06:03.333
[somber music fades]

01:06:11.375 --> 01:06:12.875
[eerie music playing]

01:06:36.750 --> 01:06:38.208
[eerie music swells]

01:06:39.041 --> 01:06:40.041
[grunts]

01:06:43.833 --> 01:06:45.208
[music fades]

01:06:45.291 --> 01:06:46.750
[gentle waves]

01:06:48.833 --> 01:06:50.833
[seagulls calling]

01:06:53.291 --> 01:06:55.291
PRIVATE PROPERTY
NO TRESPASSING

01:07:21.708 --> 01:07:23.708
[gentle music playing]

01:07:33.125 --> 01:07:33.958
[M] Lhan.

01:07:34.958 --> 01:07:36.083
Where are you going, Lhan?

01:07:36.166 --> 01:07:37.500
Away from here.

01:07:37.583 --> 01:07:40.291
Wait. This is the safest place right now.

01:07:40.875 --> 01:07:43.041
No one is safe. Not if I'm here.

01:07:43.125 --> 01:07:45.708
We're all in this together, Lhan.

01:07:45.791 --> 01:07:49.208
Seriously? How can you say that?
My father and mother are dead.

01:07:49.291 --> 01:07:51.000
We're all gonna be wiped out.

01:07:51.083 --> 01:07:52.333
Because of me.

01:07:52.416 --> 01:07:54.416
You can't blame yourself.

01:07:55.666 --> 01:07:56.708
Listen to me.

01:07:57.208 --> 01:07:59.625
Lhan, everyone in this house loves you.

01:07:59.708 --> 01:08:00.541
Love?

01:08:01.208 --> 01:08:04.083
Is it me they love? Or my blood they want?

01:08:05.375 --> 01:08:06.500
I'd give anything,

01:08:06.583 --> 01:08:08.500
anything to the people I love.

01:08:08.583 --> 01:08:11.666
But not like this.
You have all been lying to me.

01:08:13.000 --> 01:08:16.125
-Even you've never said anything.
-I had no idea!

01:08:17.291 --> 01:08:22.291
I didn't know, okay? Pran didn't either.
How could we know about your blood type?

01:08:22.791 --> 01:08:27.208
The uncles brought you to the house.
Said you had no family left.

01:08:27.833 --> 01:08:31.541
Why should we think anything's different?
I don't have anyone else either.

01:08:32.041 --> 01:08:34.041
[somber music playing]

01:08:43.458 --> 01:08:46.500
I know you think they have failed you.

01:08:49.208 --> 01:08:50.625
They failed me too.

01:08:53.250 --> 01:08:55.083
Pran will be hurting the most.

01:08:55.166 --> 01:08:57.166
[Lhan cries]

01:08:58.875 --> 01:09:00.000
But believe me,

01:09:00.500 --> 01:09:03.083
this is the best place, right here.

01:09:05.875 --> 01:09:07.458
And the two of you

01:09:08.291 --> 01:09:10.625
are so lucky to have found each other.

01:09:15.875 --> 01:09:17.875
[Lhan sobbing]

01:09:22.416 --> 01:09:23.958
Let's go home, Lhan.

01:09:31.375 --> 01:09:32.416
[grunts]

01:09:45.708 --> 01:09:46.916
[Doc] Pran, hold up.

01:09:47.916 --> 01:09:50.833
Wait. Come on.
Take it easy. Take it easy now, okay?

01:09:55.125 --> 01:09:57.541
You're recovering
faster than I thought, kid.

01:09:59.250 --> 01:10:02.375
At this rate, a couple of months,
and you'll be back to normal.

01:10:03.750 --> 01:10:04.625
Doc…

01:10:06.541 --> 01:10:09.500
I know Dad put aside some money for Lhan.

01:10:10.208 --> 01:10:11.291
He told me.

01:10:14.375 --> 01:10:16.958
Can you and M find Lhan a place to stay?

01:10:17.458 --> 01:10:19.583
Take her somewhere safe, please.

01:10:20.750 --> 01:10:23.041
Make sure she's safe and doing okay.

01:10:23.625 --> 01:10:26.541
-Then we can go our separate ways.
-Separate ways?

01:10:27.250 --> 01:10:28.166
Go where?

01:10:28.750 --> 01:10:30.375
[Pran] I just want her safe.

01:10:31.666 --> 01:10:33.291
I want everyone to be safe.

01:10:34.291 --> 01:10:36.125
We can't lose anyone else.

01:10:36.708 --> 01:10:39.041
But there's not a safe place
that we can go.

01:10:45.833 --> 01:10:47.375
Lhan will be hunted.

01:10:48.208 --> 01:10:49.958
We will be killed.

01:10:50.041 --> 01:10:54.291
The Mala gang has to wipe us out.
Otherwise, they die.

01:10:55.041 --> 01:10:57.000
It's the way our world is.

01:10:58.166 --> 01:11:00.125
It's kill or be killed.

01:11:00.708 --> 01:11:02.875
No one is going to be safe

01:11:03.458 --> 01:11:05.041
until everyone's dead.

01:11:05.625 --> 01:11:07.625
[dramatic music plays]

01:11:27.333 --> 01:11:28.458
[music fades]

01:11:38.750 --> 01:11:40.708
The day I asked you to run away…

01:11:43.041 --> 01:11:45.750
that was the day I found out
you had golden blood.

01:11:46.666 --> 01:11:49.583
I never knew
why Dad had brought you to the house.

01:11:50.083 --> 01:11:52.708
I assumed to protect you,
just like with M.

01:11:54.166 --> 01:11:55.375
I'm so sorry.

01:11:56.625 --> 01:11:58.708
On behalf of my dad and everyone,

01:11:58.791 --> 01:12:00.125
I'm sorry.

01:12:00.625 --> 01:12:02.208
Can you forgive me?

01:12:03.125 --> 01:12:04.833
I apologize.

01:12:10.416 --> 01:12:12.416
[somber music playing]

01:12:21.333 --> 01:12:22.166
Lhan.

01:12:26.208 --> 01:12:28.750
-You--
-I always feel the pain right here.

01:12:30.750 --> 01:12:32.041
It's always there

01:12:33.416 --> 01:12:35.166
when I think about my parents.

01:12:42.875 --> 01:12:45.125
I have to swallow it down every time.

01:12:46.416 --> 01:12:47.958
And it's never easy.

01:12:49.750 --> 01:12:51.833
I've had two homes in my life.

01:12:51.916 --> 01:12:54.666
And because of me,
people are dying in here now.

01:12:56.791 --> 01:12:58.833
Just like it was in my first.

01:13:01.958 --> 01:13:04.458
If there is nowhere in this world
safe for me to be,

01:13:04.541 --> 01:13:07.416
then I have to be able to protect myself.

01:13:08.250 --> 01:13:09.208
Am I right?

01:13:13.333 --> 01:13:14.166
Pran.

01:13:15.250 --> 01:13:16.500
Teach me how to kill.

01:13:20.041 --> 01:13:22.333
I don't want to be in the back seat.

01:13:22.416 --> 01:13:25.791
A fragile little girl
who needs everyone to protect me.

01:13:25.875 --> 01:13:29.750
I wanna watch them die with my own eyes.

01:13:32.541 --> 01:13:34.875
I just want to be an assassin.

01:13:35.541 --> 01:13:37.541
[tense music playing]

01:13:42.125 --> 01:13:46.208
Just because you've decided you want to,
it doesn't mean you can be one.

01:13:46.833 --> 01:13:50.375
Hm? People can spend
their whole lives training to be one.

01:13:51.291 --> 01:13:52.958
We'll go as far as we can.

01:13:54.625 --> 01:13:56.875
If she at least knows
how to protect herself,

01:13:57.375 --> 01:13:58.416
it's better for everyone.

01:14:00.333 --> 01:14:03.625
And if she can protect herself,
then she chooses whether she goes or not.

01:14:05.250 --> 01:14:06.875
It's her choice.

01:14:08.458 --> 01:14:12.541
You're so casual about it all.
You're putting her in danger.

01:14:13.750 --> 01:14:15.625
We're up against assassins.

01:14:15.708 --> 01:14:17.000
Not a grandma.

01:14:18.333 --> 01:14:21.291
Let's do what Pran was saying.
It is what it is.

01:14:21.375 --> 01:14:24.625
Maybe the grandmother
is worse than a killer.

01:14:25.916 --> 01:14:26.875
[Lhek sighs]

01:14:27.625 --> 01:14:28.625
[sighs]

01:14:31.166 --> 01:14:32.583
-You ready?
-What?

01:14:32.666 --> 01:14:34.666
[music intensifies]

01:14:35.875 --> 01:14:37.875
[Lhan] Come on. Come on.

01:14:37.958 --> 01:14:39.625
-Uh…
-Bring it.

01:14:39.708 --> 01:14:41.208
Uh…

01:14:45.625 --> 01:14:46.958
Shit.

01:14:54.541 --> 01:14:56.708
-Come on.
-Huh?

01:14:56.791 --> 01:14:57.666
Get in.

01:14:59.250 --> 01:15:00.291
[grunting]

01:15:03.708 --> 01:15:04.625
[Lhek grunts]

01:15:04.708 --> 01:15:06.083
[music fades]

01:15:07.000 --> 01:15:09.000
[sighs]

01:15:11.333 --> 01:15:13.583
Your thinking and reactions are good.

01:15:13.666 --> 01:15:16.375
Leg power, punches are your weak points.

01:15:16.458 --> 01:15:19.541
Speed, flexibility,
and accuracy need work.

01:15:20.041 --> 01:15:20.958
Impulsive.

01:15:21.583 --> 01:15:23.750
Hey, you're just charging in.

01:15:23.833 --> 01:15:24.875
Know your limits.

01:15:24.958 --> 01:15:27.583
Fight like that,
you're dying before grandma.

01:15:27.666 --> 01:15:28.666
[sighs]

01:15:29.916 --> 01:15:31.125
If you're serious, let's begin.

01:15:31.208 --> 01:15:32.958
[tense music playing]

01:15:35.208 --> 01:15:39.625
[Pran] Tactics, combat, weapons, strength.
There's a lot to learn quickly.

01:15:40.125 --> 01:15:43.875
If you want to be a killer,
you start by being unkillable.

01:15:46.041 --> 01:15:48.041
[music intensifies]

01:16:09.833 --> 01:16:11.000
Begin.

01:16:19.083 --> 01:16:20.125
Hm.

01:16:20.916 --> 01:16:25.041
Very good.
Keep pulling. Needle tip up, okay.

01:16:27.875 --> 01:16:28.916
[clicks tongue]

01:16:29.625 --> 01:16:30.625
Again.

01:16:33.833 --> 01:16:35.000
[M grunts]

01:16:35.666 --> 01:16:36.750
[Lhek] Get up.

01:16:36.833 --> 01:16:38.708
Up. Go again.

01:16:40.583 --> 01:16:41.708
[grunts softly]

01:16:42.916 --> 01:16:43.833
[Pran] Tense up.

01:16:43.916 --> 01:16:45.541
And breathe. Let's go.

01:16:45.625 --> 01:16:47.083
[gasps, holds breath]

01:16:47.166 --> 01:16:48.041
[M grunts]

01:16:48.125 --> 01:16:49.625
-[Pran grunts]
-[Lhan sighs]

01:16:49.708 --> 01:16:51.541
-[Lhek] Again.
-[Pran grunts]

01:16:51.625 --> 01:16:52.666
[M grunts]

01:16:53.666 --> 01:16:55.500
[tense music continues]

01:17:03.916 --> 01:17:06.166
Wow. Hey.

01:17:06.250 --> 01:17:07.375
Nice work.

01:17:18.375 --> 01:17:20.375
-[thuds]
-[blades whooshing]

01:17:50.333 --> 01:17:52.791
[music peaks, then fades]

01:17:56.208 --> 01:17:57.333
[door opens]

01:17:59.125 --> 01:18:00.041
[door closes]

01:18:00.125 --> 01:18:01.416
[approaching footsteps]

01:18:18.000 --> 01:18:20.000
[gentle music playing]

01:19:09.625 --> 01:19:11.000
If I don't make it…

01:19:13.375 --> 01:19:14.750
can you look after her?

01:19:16.833 --> 01:19:17.666
Pran,

01:19:19.166 --> 01:19:20.500
what are you saying?

01:19:20.583 --> 01:19:22.083
You can't think like that.

01:19:22.833 --> 01:19:25.833
Just saying, if I do, you look after her.

01:19:26.958 --> 01:19:28.708
I don't want her left alone.

01:19:35.000 --> 01:19:36.791
Have you even realized

01:19:37.916 --> 01:19:39.583
that I care for her too?

01:19:40.333 --> 01:19:41.333
Sure.

01:19:42.500 --> 01:19:43.916
I can see it for miles.

01:19:51.166 --> 01:19:52.833
[Pran sighs]

01:19:56.958 --> 01:19:58.375
When

01:19:59.583 --> 01:20:01.166
do you think they'll find us?

01:20:07.250 --> 01:20:09.250
[eerie music playing]

01:20:17.750 --> 01:20:21.166
Hello, sir.
Are you after anything in particular?

01:20:21.250 --> 01:20:22.291
USED CAR DEALERSHIP

01:20:27.041 --> 01:20:29.000
[man] This van, has it been here long?

01:20:29.083 --> 01:20:30.750
A little while, but not that long.

01:20:30.833 --> 01:20:32.625
NO DOWN PAYMENT

01:20:33.750 --> 01:20:34.583
Move.

01:20:39.583 --> 01:20:40.833
Here you are.

01:20:41.750 --> 01:20:42.666
Okay.

01:20:44.625 --> 01:20:45.458
Hmm.

01:20:46.791 --> 01:20:47.833
Okay,

01:20:47.916 --> 01:20:49.208
it says two months.

01:20:49.291 --> 01:20:51.250
[eerie music continues]

01:20:55.416 --> 01:20:58.083
Can you tell me where they went?

01:20:58.166 --> 01:20:59.458
[music fades]

01:21:19.333 --> 01:21:22.708
[Pran] You need a lot of force
to hit a critical organ or artery.

01:21:23.333 --> 01:21:24.458
And luck.

01:21:27.583 --> 01:21:29.125
The skill of a surgeon.

01:21:32.750 --> 01:21:34.666
Vital points are hard to reach.

01:21:34.750 --> 01:21:36.875
The body is built to protect itself.

01:21:40.708 --> 01:21:41.916
Look at it like armor,

01:21:42.541 --> 01:21:43.958
with the rib cage here.

01:21:44.041 --> 01:21:47.166
It's protecting the critical arteries
tucked in behind it.

01:21:53.708 --> 01:21:54.666
I'm sorry.

01:21:56.250 --> 01:21:57.500
Let me explain better.

01:22:06.833 --> 01:22:07.666
Here.

01:22:09.958 --> 01:22:11.583
These two points are crucial.

01:22:13.125 --> 01:22:15.291
Hard to hit from distance.

01:22:15.375 --> 01:22:18.750
But in close, it's lethal
with a quick stab or a cut.

01:22:19.833 --> 01:22:20.833
Okay?

01:22:22.583 --> 01:22:23.791
Remember it, Lhan.

01:22:28.750 --> 01:22:31.916
-Wouldn't the stomach be easier?
-Uh…

01:22:34.791 --> 01:22:35.791
Not really.

01:22:40.125 --> 01:22:41.875
In fact, the main artery,

01:22:42.541 --> 01:22:45.583
the aorta,
starts at the left of the heart.

01:22:47.958 --> 01:22:50.625
But then curves around to the back.

01:22:54.666 --> 01:22:55.541
Down the spine.

01:23:00.041 --> 01:23:01.916
Through the diaphragm.

01:23:03.833 --> 01:23:05.416
Into the abdomen.

01:23:10.416 --> 01:23:11.916
Protected in deep.

01:23:15.416 --> 01:23:18.333
Covered by fat and skin,

01:23:19.458 --> 01:23:20.791
muscle as well.

01:23:23.375 --> 01:23:24.833
For a fatal blow,

01:23:25.666 --> 01:23:27.541
you must be close enough,

01:23:28.166 --> 01:23:29.958
and fully commit yourself.

01:23:30.041 --> 01:23:31.375
It's the only way.

01:23:37.333 --> 01:23:39.000
-I'll go again.
-Lhan.

01:23:43.500 --> 01:23:46.000
Once you know
how to take care of yourself…

01:23:48.541 --> 01:23:49.916
will you please stay?

01:24:06.125 --> 01:24:08.000
["Edge of the Ocean" by The Coast playing]

01:24:08.083 --> 01:24:12.791
♪ Edge of the ocean ♪

01:24:13.833 --> 01:24:20.541
♪ I fall in slow motion ♪

01:24:21.500 --> 01:24:25.333
♪ What if ♪

01:24:25.416 --> 01:24:30.625
♪ You just stay? ♪

01:24:31.333 --> 01:24:36.083
♪ Here in the blue fade ♪

01:24:36.833 --> 01:24:38.291
♪ Here ♪

01:24:39.000 --> 01:24:44.125
♪ Under the cold wave ♪

01:24:44.833 --> 01:24:51.083
♪ I can't leave you ♪

01:24:56.375 --> 01:25:01.458
♪ Telling yourself
That you can't no more ♪

01:25:05.500 --> 01:25:10.083
♪ Tell me right now
What you loved me for ♪

01:25:14.291 --> 01:25:20.708
♪ If you don't know, then I don't know ♪

01:25:23.291 --> 01:25:30.208
♪ If you don't know
Then I don't know you ♪

01:25:31.833 --> 01:25:33.916
♪ Oh ♪

01:25:46.375 --> 01:25:49.708
♪ I don't wanna say
I don't wanna say ♪

01:25:49.791 --> 01:25:53.000
♪ I don't wanna say it ♪

01:25:57.291 --> 01:25:59.291
[song fading gradually]

01:26:03.458 --> 01:26:05.000
Who's hungry?

01:26:05.500 --> 01:26:07.375
-[M] Oh.
-[Lhek] Oh, wow.

01:26:07.458 --> 01:26:08.625
Thank you.

01:26:11.208 --> 01:26:13.458
