01:27:53.125 --> 01:27:54.125
We do.

01:27:54.833 --> 01:27:57.208
[Lhek] Hey, wait, wait, wait, wait.

01:27:59.500 --> 01:28:01.375
How many are we?

01:28:01.458 --> 01:28:02.708
